"pos": "<p class=\"cap2\"><b>Right hand, lines 1–2:</b> the C position, 1 2 3 4 5 from middle C to G. <b>Line 3:</b> the hand opens; the thumb stays on C, so G A G F E C is 4 5 4 3 2 1.</p><p class=\"cap2\"><b>L:</b> the low G in <i>din, dan, don</i> is the left hand’s. Both hands meet on page 3.</p>",
